<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;US PATENT 11152372&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"US patent 11152372 is a patent that outlines a novel approach to fabricating integrated circuits and memory devices, filed by a team of researchers from the University of California, Berkeley."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF CALIFORNIA, BERKELEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"University of California, Berkeley is the institution where the researchers filed the patent for the method used in forming integrated circuitry and memory circuitry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TECHCORP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TechCorp is a company involved in a patent infringement lawsuit against ChipMaster, alleging willful infringement of their patent rights."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHIPMASTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"ChipMaster is a leading semiconductor manufacturer accused of willfully infringing on TechCorp's patent rights by using the patented method in their production process."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNITED STATES COURT OF APPEALS FOR THE FEDERAL CIRCUIT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"United States Court of Appeals for the Federal Circuit is the court where the oral argument took place in the case of _TechCorp v. ChipMaster_."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JAMES R. JOHNSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"James R. Johnson is a renowned patent attorney who led the legal team for TechCorp in the oral argument."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMILY J. LEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Emily J. Lee is a patent litigator who led the legal team for ChipMaster in the oral argument."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TECHCORP V. CHIPMASTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TechCorp v. ChipMaster is a landmark patent infringement lawsuit involving the method used in forming integrated circuitry and memory circuitry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ORAL ARGUMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Oral Argument is a live presentation before the court by opposing parties on the merits of a case, specifically in the case of _TechCorp v. ChipMaster_."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF ELECTRONIC ENGINEERING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Journal of Electronic Engineering is a publication that published a study on the impact of the patented method on production costs and manufacturing efficiency."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON ELECTRON DEVICES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"IEEE Transactions on Electron Devices is a publication that published a study on the effects of the patented method on the reliability of microchips."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. JOHN SMITH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. John Smith is a renowned expert in semiconductor technology and professor at Stanford University who commented on the significance of the patent filing."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOM MITCHELL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tom Mitchell is the CEO of the Semiconductor Industry Association who commented on the significance of the patent filing."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEMICONDUCTOR INDUSTRY ASSOCIATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Semiconductor Industry Association is an organization that represents the interests of semiconductor manufacturers and promotes the development of the semiconductor industry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GARTNER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gartner is a leading industry research firm that provided data on the global semiconductor market and the memory market growth projections."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GLOBAL SEMICONDUCTOR MARKET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Global Semiconductor Market refers to the overall market for semiconductors, which is projected to grow significantly."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEMORY MARKET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Memory Market refers to the market for memory devices, which is expected to grow at a CAGR of 12.3% from 2020 to 2025."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Artificial Intelligence is a technology area that could benefit from the new method of forming integrated circuitry and memory circuitry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;5G NETWORKS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"5G Networks is a telecommunications technology that could be enhanced by the new method of forming integrated circuitry and memory circuitry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNET OF THINGS (IOT)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Internet of Things (IoT) is a network of physical devices, vehicles, home appliances, and other items embedded with sensors, software, and connectivity, which could be improved by the new method."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADVANCED TECHNOLOGIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Advanced Technologies refer to various cutting-edge technologies that could be developed more efficiently with the new method of forming integrated circuitry and memory circuitry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRODUCTION COSTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Production Costs refer to the financial aspect of manufacturing microchips and memory devices, which could be reduced by the new method."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PATENT FILING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The patent filing is a significant event in the world of electronics, marking a major milestone in the development of integrated circuitry and memory circuitry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ELECTRONICS INDUSTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The electronics industry is the domain where the patent filing is significant, indicating its impact on the sector."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTEGRATED CIRCUITRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Integrated circuitry is a key component developed as part of the patent filing, playing a crucial role in the electronics industry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEMORY CIRCUITRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Memory circuitry is another key component developed as part of the patent filing, playing a crucial role in the electronics industry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INDUSTRY EVOLUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Industry evolution refers to the ongoing development and advancement within the electronics industry, which is influenced by the patent filing."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0380</data>
    </node>
